Written by hand for this repository on 2026-11-19 (CC0 1.0: no rights
reserved), no third-party content, for unit m8-i (settings from another
design, properties addendum 6.3 and 17; ledger row M8). A project file
holding only its meta and sheet list, so KiCad reads every setting at its
own default; a four copper layer board (F.Cu, In1.Cu, In2.Cu, B.Cu) with a
40 by 30 mm outline and nothing else; an empty one-sheet schematic. The
board and the schematic were written as KiCad s-expressions by hand, then
loaded and saved by KiCad 10.0's own writers (kicad-cli pcb upgrade and sch
upgrade); nothing was changed by hand after that save.
tests/e2e/settings-read.spec.ts opens it in a pcb frame and in a sch frame,
then reads settings-from's setup into it with settings.read. files.json
lists the files the e2e harness opens. The KiCad files carry no comment, so
this file holds their license.
